What is a 65W GaN Charger?
65W GaN chargers are compact, high-efficiency power adapters utilizing Gallium Nitride (GaN) semiconductor technology that delivers superior performance compared to traditional silicon-based chargers. These advanced charging solutions offer higher power density, better thermal performance, and reduced energy loss, making them ideal for modern high-power applications across smartphones, laptops, and tablets.

